<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2156579528"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1744084126"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Fighting My Way"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="初星学園 / Giga / 長月あおい"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Fighting My Way"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:19.907"><div begin="00:02.044" end="03:14.087"><p begin="00:02.044" end="00:05.277" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Now I’m ready, I’m ready to go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我已经做好准备启程出发</span></p><p begin="00:05.430" end="00:08.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">花が咲く時が来たんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">花朵绽放的时刻到来</span></p><p begin="00:09.363" end="00:12.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Are you ready? わかるでしょ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你准备好了吗? 你心里很清楚吧</span></p><p begin="00:12.445" end="00:15.411" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">やってみせる Make it through<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会让你见识到的 顺利渡过难关</span></p><p begin="00:16.623" end="00:19.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">ほら そんな ソワソワしてたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 如果一直像这样忐忑不安</span></p><p begin="00:20.036" end="00:21.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">時は過ぎちゃうから 今すぐにさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时光可不会等人 立马行动起来吧</span></p><p begin="00:22.071" end="00:23.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Let’s work it out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们解决问题吧</span></p><p begin="00:23.937" end="00:27.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">もう 目を 背けやしないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经 不会再选择逃避了</span></p><p begin="00:27.189" end="00:28.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">自分で Make it better<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由自己来改善现状 创造正确答案</span></p><p begin="00:29.054" end="00:30.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">作る正解を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">得来的正解</span></p><p begin="00:31.205" end="00:33.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I just wanna, just wanna find somebody<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是想要 我只是想要找一个</span></p><p begin="00:34.354" end="00:38.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">私よりも強気な ダレカ Uh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比我更加刚强果断的人</span></p><p begin="00:38.473" end="00:40.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">夢中になる Make you hot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全身心投入 让你热血沸腾</span></p><p begin="00:40.205" end="00:41.805" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">準備体操お済みですか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经完全做好准备了吗?</span></p><p begin="00:41.805" end="00:42.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">掴むんだ Victory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将胜利紧握在手</span></p><p begin="00:42.887" end="00:44.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">So now let’s start the war!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以此刻就让我们开启战役</span></p><p begin="00:44.877" end="00:46.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I’m fighting my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正在奋力前行</span></p><p begin="00:46.652" end="00:48.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I’m fighting my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正在奋力前行</span></p><p begin="00:48.402" end="00:49.939" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">夢の未来 Ay-ay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需坚信梦想的未来勇往直前</span></p><p begin="00:49.939" end="00:52.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">信じて進むだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并坚定的前行即可</span></p><p begin="00:52.106" end="00:53.656" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">誰にも絶対<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本就不打算要输给任何人</span></p><p begin="00:53.856" end="00:56.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">負ける気なんかない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">输给任何人</span></p><p begin="00:56.160" end="01:00.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">君に見せたいの 彼方の景色を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你看到远方的景色</span></p><p begin="01:00.175" end="01:02.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">恋に踊れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为爱起舞 倾注所有热情</span></p><p begin="01:02.266" end="01:03.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">情熱全て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倾尽热情</span></p><p begin="01:04.084" end="01:07.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">もっと先を知りたい もう止まらない Ay-ay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对未知充斥无限渴望</span></p><p begin="01:07.559" end="01:09.341" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">I will lead the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将会带领前路</span></p><p begin="01:09.579" end="01:11.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Just come along my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需要跟着我来</span></p><p begin="01:11.208" end="01:11.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别破坏我的氛围</span></p><p begin="01:11.762" end="01:12.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Don’t kill my vibe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Don’t kill my vibe</span></p><p begin="01:13.034" end="01:15.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">行こう 一番上まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前行吧 直至巅峰之上</span></p><p begin="01:15.714" end="01:17.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">ちょっと待ってよなんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">稍微等一下</span></p><p begin="01:17.231" end="01:19.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">誤解なら困っちゃうな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果产生误解就麻烦了</span></p><p begin="01:19.131" end="01:22.042" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ねぇ 蹴落とすため 戦う訳ではないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 并非为了排挤对方</span></p><p begin="01:22.219" end="01:24.326" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Just wanna keep challenging myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是想要不断挑战我自己而已</span></p><p begin="01:24.483" end="01:27.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">こんな Fantasy ハマったら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦沉迷于自我的幻想之中</span></p><p begin="01:27.900" end="01:30.312" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">もっともっと欲しくなっちゃうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便会变得愈发抑制不住自身的欲望</span></p><p begin="01:31.163" end="01:34.532" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">もう 何も 恐れはしないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经 不会再有任何畏惧了</span></p><p begin="01:34.552" end="01:36.497" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">君となら行ける気がするから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你一起感觉就能无往不前</span></p><p begin="01:36.581" end="01:38.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Come join us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来加入我们吧</span></p><p begin="01:38.447" end="01:41.713" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">ほら 今 聞こえて来るから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你听 此刻 已传入我的耳畔</span></p><p begin="01:41.814" end="01:44.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Yea, 私の名を呼ぶ方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔向呼唤我名字的地方</span></p><p begin="01:44.792" end="01:46.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">I’m fighting my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正在奋力前行</span></p><p begin="01:46.558" end="01:48.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">I’m fighting my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正在奋力前行</span></p><p begin="01:48.396" end="01:50.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">夢の未来 Ay-ay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需坚信梦想的未来勇往直前</span></p><p begin="01:50.017" end="01:52.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">信じて進むだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并坚定的前行即可</span></p><p begin="01:52.049" end="01:53.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">誰にも絶対<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本就不打算要输给任何人</span></p><p begin="01:53.883" end="01:56.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">負ける気なんかない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">输给任何人</span></p><p begin="01:56.116" end="02:00.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">君に見せたいの 彼方の景色を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想让你看到远方的景色</span></p><p begin="02:00.719" end="02:03.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">雨を受け 夜を抜け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迎接落雨 穿越黑夜</span></p><p begin="02:04.370" end="02:08.617" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">青空の光 求めた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追寻那道天光</span></p><p begin="02:08.694" end="02:10.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Whoa<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Whoa</span></p><p begin="02:10.860" end="02:12.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">一つも無駄はないさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何努力都绝非徒劳</span></p><p begin="02:13.134" end="02:16.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">力(パワー)に変えて 輝いてくから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它们将化作力量绽放光彩</span></p><p begin="02:17.275" end="02:20.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">KIRA KIRA 雫弾けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">璀璨夺目 水滴四溅</span></p><p begin="02:20.695" end="02:23.893" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">Ah 神の思し召しだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是神的旨意</span></p><p begin="02:23.893" end="02:25.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">連れてくよ Make you high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带你一起攀上巅峰</span></p><p begin="02:25.696" end="02:27.245" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">後悔はさせませんわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不会让你感到悔恨</span></p><p begin="02:27.245" end="02:28.234" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">超えるんだ Boundary<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样超越那道界限吧</span></p><p begin="02:28.234" end="02:29.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">So now let’s start the war!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以此刻就让我们开启战役</span></p><p begin="02:30.244" end="02:31.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">I’m fighting with myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正在与我自己勇敢奋斗</span></p><p begin="02:32.078" end="02:33.744" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">I’m fighting with myself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我正在与我自己勇敢奋斗</span></p><p begin="02:33.860" end="02:35.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">負けなんてない Ay-ay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的字典不存在认输</span></p><p begin="02:35.460" end="02:37.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">勝負受けて立つだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只会勇敢接受比赛</span></p><p begin="02:37.559" end="02:39.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">もう自分以外<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除我自己 没有人能战胜我</span></p><p begin="02:39.329" end="02:41.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">私に勝てない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经没有人能够战胜我</span></p><p begin="02:41.645" end="02:45.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">君がいれば 何度も立ち上がるわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要有你在 我就能无数次振作起来</span></p><p begin="02:45.729" end="02:47.493" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">愛を歌え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">歌唱爱意 倾注所有思绪</span></p><p begin="02:47.678" end="02:49.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">想い全て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倾尽心意</span></p><p begin="02:49.530" end="02:53.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">逃げたくはない 待てない まだ終われない Ay-ay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿选择逃避 根本无法等待</span></p><p begin="02:53.054" end="02:54.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">I need you to stay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要你的陪伴</span></p><p begin="02:54.913" end="02:56.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">You make me feel okay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我感觉如此美好</span></p><p begin="02:56.644" end="02:57.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">Hey!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是时候闪耀出自我来了</span></p><p begin="02:57.211" end="02:58.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">It’s time to shine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">It’s time to shine</span></p><p begin="02:58.468" end="03:00.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">行こう 空の上まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前行吧 企及天际之上</span></p><p begin="03:02.111" end="03:03.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">Weh oh weh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Weh oh weh oh</span></p><p begin="03:05.696" end="03:07.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">Ram pam pam para pum pum pa<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ram pam pam para pum pum pa</span></p><p begin="03:09.361" end="03:11.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L78">Weh oh weh oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Weh oh weh oh</span></p><p begin="03:12.269" end="03:14.087" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L79">Ahhh ooh uh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ahhh ooh uh</span></p></div></body></tt>